# Public site — no env vars required for v1.

# Recommended when using a custom domain on Vercel:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://getyourproductbuilt.com

# Case study Loom walkthroughs (defaults also live in lib/site.ts):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOOM_LEAD_QUALIFIER=https://www.loom.com/share/1f7bb81420ab4dd191bb487ca38cbf65
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOOM_INBOX=https://www.loom.com/share/5d77568456754699beb9e7bdf627d1d6
# NEXT_PUBLIC_LOOM_WEEKLY_REPORT=https://www.loom.com/share/4a253bede72d4ce99bc0b16c041a88d8

# Internal marketing dashboard (/tools/marketing) — local dev example:
# MARKETING_DASHBOARD_SECRET=choose-a-long-password-only-you-know
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Default for digests / ops / non-LinkedIn helpers:
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# LinkedIn personal-profile drafts use the flagship writing model by default:
# LINKEDIN_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6
# MARKETING_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=...
# MARKETING_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=...
# Google OAuth redirect auto-derives as {NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL}/api/marketing/google/callback
# Scopes: Calendar events, Gmail compose (drafts), Gmail readonly (F5Bot inbox scan)
# After adding readonly, reconnect Google from the dashboard once.

# F5Bot inbox scan (Growth dashboard + optional launchd). Header: x-f5bot-scan-secret
# F5BOT_SCAN_SECRET=choose-a-long-random-string
# F5BOT_SCAN_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Agent operations event relay. Set a long random value and send it only from
# a trusted integration relay as x-operations-webhook-secret. Provider-specific
# Stripe/Cal.com signature verification should be added before direct webhooks.
# OPERATIONS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...
